## Testing note
The exact direction and score can vary because event extraction is performed by an LLM. The `sensitivity` and `exposure_weight` values in this demo dataset are configuration assumptions, not reported company forecasts. Use these questions to validate routing, grounding, follow-up memory, direct-table lookup and explainability rather than investment performance.
